WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:31.266
"Here," the ogre's wife said.

2
00:00:31.267 --> 00:00:37.599
She put a bowl of porridge in front of Jack.

3
00:00:37.600 --> 00:00:41.128
Jack gulped down the food.

4
00:00:41.129 --> 00:00:59.930
It was hot and delicious.

5
00:00:59.931 --> 00:01:02.076
"Thank you," Jack said.

6
00:01:02.077 --> 00:01:06.583
He got to his feet. "I'll go now before—"

7
00:01:06.584 --> 00:01:09.092
Thump! Thump! Thump!

8
00:01:09.093 --> 00:01:11.864
Footsteps shook the house like thunder.

9
00:01:11.865 --> 00:01:15.703
"Oh no!" The woman began to shake with fear.

10
00:01:15.704 --> 00:01:19.356
"My husband is coming!" she cried.

11
00:01:19.357 --> 00:01:22.771
"Quick, boy! Hide!"

12
00:01:22.772 --> 00:01:24.856
Jack froze.

13
00:01:24.857 --> 00:01:26.919
Thump! Thump! Thump!

14
00:01:26.920 --> 00:01:30.353
The ogre was coming closer!

15
00:01:30.354 --> 00:01:36.252
"Where can I hide?" Jack asked.

16
00:01:36.253 --> 00:01:38.881
"There!" the ogre's wife said.

17
00:01:38.882 --> 00:01:41.147
She pointed to the oven.

18
00:01:41.148 --> 00:01:43.996
"Hide in there! Quick!"

19
00:01:43.997 --> 00:01:46.886
Thump! Thump! Thump!

20
00:01:46.887 --> 00:01:55.249
Just as the ogre entered, Jack jumped into the oven.

21
00:01:55.250 --> 00:02:10.769
He peeked out through a crack in the door.

22
00:02:10.770 --> 00:02:14.123
"The ogre is huge!" Jack thought.

23
00:02:14.124 --> 00:02:18.053
The ogre had sharp teeth and a nasty smile.

24
00:02:18.054 --> 00:02:21.313
A large pouch hung from his belt.

25
00:02:21.314 --> 00:02:24.985
"Good morning, Wife," the ogre said.

26
00:02:24.986 --> 00:02:30.174
"I'm back from my hunt."

27
00:02:30.175 --> 00:02:33.253
The ogre tossed the pouch on the table.

28
00:02:33.254 --> 00:02:37.547
"Cook these for my breakfast!" he growled.

29
00:02:37.548 --> 00:02:41.650
"This ogre is rude too!" Jack thought.

30
00:02:41.651 --> 00:02:43.644
Sniff, sniff.

31
00:02:43.645 --> 00:02:47.165
Jack's heart beat fast as the ogre sniffed the air.

32
00:02:47.166 --> 00:02:52.913
Sniff, sniff.

33
00:02:52.914 --> 00:03:02.971
The ogre roared. "What's that smell?"

